Puzzle Box was added in '''Beta 30.0''', obtainable through an enemy's Rouxls Kaard. For 3G, it will Silence all enemy Rouxls Kaard, making it intentionally very weak, much like Pre-Beta 56.0 [[Annoying Dog|Dog Residue]]. '''Beta 54.1''' changed it to allow the owner to Silence any monster, making it much more useful, but still weak due to being a [[Penetration]] with triple the cost.

=== Stats ===
Main Spell giver: Rouxls Kaard

Cost: 3

Effects:

* Silence all enemy Rouxls Kaard. (Post Beta 30.0)
* Silence a monster. (Post Beta 54.1, Current)

Rarity: Green (Generated/Token)
